&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a talented privacy and data security attorney to join our Legal team, reporting directly to our Counsel Vice President. You will be an integral part of a highly collaborative team, interacting closely with various stakeholders across the organization. In this role, you will provide critical privacy and data security legal advice to the business, including on new state privacy laws, artificial intelligence, commercial and service provider agreements, and incident response matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role with an expectation of three days per week in our New York City office, located at One Madison Avenue in Manhattan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the specific responsibilities outlined above, employees may be required to perform other such duties as assigned by the Company. This ensures operational flexibility and allows the Company to meet evolving business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
