&lt;li&gt;Provide legal review for privacy and data security policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain up-to-date expert knowledge of privacy, data protection, and AI laws, regulations, pending legislation and market practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide advice to FanDuel’s business teams on with applicable privacy, data security, and AI laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, draft and/or negotiate the privacy and data security portions of contracts with vendors and business partners, in collaboration with the Commercial Legal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review artificial intelligence projects, acting as a subject matter expert in privacy, cybersecurity, and AI regulation. Coordinate as relevant with other stakeholders from Legal and Compliance to ensure appropriate legal review of other risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on cybersecurity incident preparation and response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build close relationships with and be a trusted advisor to teams across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide sound business judgment, confidence, a sense of ownership, drive, comfort making tough calls where the answer is not clear, and an aptitude to quickly learn the nuances of the internet, technology, and media businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
