&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of legal experience, primarily focused on investigations or regulatory enforcement, preferably including experience at a state regulatory or enforcement body&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging and advocating with regulators, including with mandatory reporting requirements&lt;u&gt;,&lt;/u&gt; with prior gaming experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong aptitude for legal research, problem-solving, policy analysis, and advocacy, preferably in an evolving or new area of the law&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal, written, and strategic communication skills and an ability to collaborate effectively across external and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic and commitment to being an exceptional team player who rolls up their sleeves;&lt;/li&gt;
