&lt;p&gt;Once hired, the senior Counsel for Regulatory may be required to obtain state gaming&amp;nbsp;&lt;s&gt; &lt;/s&gt;licenses from various jurisdictions in order to represent FanDuel before regulators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
