&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in data science, analytics, quantitative research, or engineering preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a highly numerate major (Math, Stats, Econ, Computer Science, Engineering, etc.) or relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Python or R and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and deploying models for production products and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with simulation or back testing is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
