&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive forward the execution of outside counsel management strategy, aligning on billing guidelines, rate structures and performance metrics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and evolve the development of the 1-3 year strategy for outside counsel management and operational transformation within Legal Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in and project manage the strategic planning and budgeting processes for outside counsel spend, driving accountability and alignment with corporate financial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to support firm relationship governance, promoting best practices, cost transparency and partnership value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct spend benchmarking and market analysis to inform rate negotiations and educate our matter leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee reporting and analytics within Brightflag to deliver actionable spend insights and business intelligence to Legal leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage invoice review, approval workflows, accruals, and budgeting processes to ensure compliance with billing guidelines and financial accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with IT, Finance, Procurement and Accounts Payable stakeholders to enhance system capabilities and data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with the legal operations community, industry forums and vendor networks to identify emerging best practices and translate external insights into improvements across FanDuel&#39;s Legal Operations function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with vendor management and support the vendor negotiation process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and project manage legal projects, ensuring timely and successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop project plans, timelines, and deliverables, and track progress against goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior leaders to develop and implement the legal department’s strategic plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and recommendations to improve legal processes and support business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of continuous improvement, collaboration, and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with a strong bias for action, proactively identifying opportunities, driving initiatives forward independently, and exercising sound judgement on when to escalate or seek alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across the Legal and Compliance organization, influencing lawyers and business stakeholders to adopt best practices and program improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document processes, develop workflow diagrams and create clear visual artefacts to support operational improvements and stakeholder understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong commercial and financial understanding of legal services delivery, billing models and spend management to optimize value from outside counsel relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE STATS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we&#39;re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in Legal Operations, Finance, or related roles, with deep expertise in outside counsel management and eBilling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4 years of in depth Brightflag experience at a minimum (system administration, reporting, and configuration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading cross-functional legal spend management programs in a global or matrixed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen with expertise in budgeting, forecasting, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in law firm performance management, benchmarking, and billing guideline enforcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with diverse stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion to work hard in a fast-paced, start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; MBA, or equivalent advanced degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional team builder and team player, with a desire to be a leader within FanDuel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
