&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE POSITION&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Customer Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to help execute lifecycle marketing strategies for &lt;strong&gt;FanDuel Predicts&lt;/strong&gt;, driving engagement and long-term customer value across every stage of the customer journey from onboarding and activation through retention and re-engagement. Working closely with cross-functional partners, you&#39;ll bring lifecycle campaigns to market, analyze performance, and identify opportunities to optimize the customer experience. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys combining data-driven insights with creative thinking to deliver personalized campaigns that improve customer engagement and business outcomes while continuing to grow as a lifecycle marketer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role sits at the intersection of strategy and operations. You&#39;ll combine strategic thinking with hands-on operational excellence - diagnosing customer behavior problems, developing data-driven hypotheses, designing and optimizing customer journeys, orchestrating promotional and communications campaigns, and continuously improving based on learnings. You&#39;ll think independently, challenge assumptions, and identify opportunities to improve reactivation, retention, and customer lifetime value. This role is ideal for someone who thrives on ownership, combines analytical rigor with creative problem-solving, and wants to meaningfully shape how FanDuel connects with and grows its customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the specific responsibilities outlined above, employees may be required to perform other such duties as assigned by the Company. This ensures operational flexibility and allows the Company to meet evolving business needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and execution of core lifecycle marketing strategies across retention, monetization, and re-engagement stages using advanced segmentation, leveraging communication and promotional capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps and opportunities to improve key metrics, develop business cases, and partner with Marketing leadership to shape roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute end-to-end campaigns at scale. Ensure flawless execution and own ongoing performance monitoring and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Commercial, Analytics, Product, and CRM Operations to identify lifecycle initiatives and recommend improvements based on customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain customer audiences and segments using behavioral and transactional data to deliver more relevant customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify experimentation opportunities to improve core metrics. Develop hypotheses, design A/B tests and multivariate experiments, partner with Analytics to understand impact, and scale learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into compelling stories that drive action. Monitor campaign performance and customer behavior to identify optimization opportunities and improve lifecycle journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive personalization and automation by leveraging real-time signals to deliver the right message, at the right time, through the right channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with marketing technology and data teams to enhance automation capabilities, audience targeting, and measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on market insights, data science, and product roadmaps to improve lifecycle outcomes and deepen understanding of customer behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage strong expertise in lifecycle marketing best practices, influencing broader marketing, product, and promotional strategies across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate campaign performance and customer behavior to iterate on strategies that increase retention, engagement frequency, and overall customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI strategically. Use modern tools to enhance analysis and productivity while maintaining critical thinking and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
