&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;We are seeking &lt;/span&gt;a confident, experienced designer within our Core Product &amp;amp; Experiences team, ready to&amp;nbsp;expand their scope of work and take on increased leadership responsibilities while continuing to grow&amp;nbsp;their expertise and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
