&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Designer, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Explore and shape ideas grounded in user and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Lead small to medium-sized projects with growing independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Deliver high-quality UX and UI design thinking across journeys, ensuring experiences are intuitive, consistent, and meet strong visual and interaction standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Use prototyping and testing to validate solutions and inform iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Leverage AI tooling to accelerate design iteration, research synthesis, and content generation, while maintaining human judgment about when and how AI adds real value to ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply and contribute to the design system, ensuring consistency and scalability in your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Identify user pain points and propose effective, practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Embed accessibility and inclusive design best practices in your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Communicator, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Clearly present design ideas, rationale, and trade-offs to a range of audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Incorporate feedback thoughtfully to strengthen outcomes and ensure alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Use storytelling techniques to connect design decisions to user needs and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Proactively look for opportunities to share your work to relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a team player, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, and Design to deliver high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Contribute / co-facilitate workshops and team discussions that clarify goals and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Partner with UXR/UXA to gather insights and translate research into actionable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Participate in recruiting and onboarding activities to support team growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Help teammates develop their own AI literacy and workflows, sharing what works, what doesn&#39;t, and how to stay thoughtful about its use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As you expand your impact, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Take ownership of projects with support from senior designers, managing priorities and navigating challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Provide thoughtful feedback to peers and support junior designers in their development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Actively seek coaching and self-development to continue refining your craft, communication, and strategic thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE STATS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What we’re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;3+ years of product design experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Experience contributing to multiple shipped projects, demonstrating solid design craft and functional knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Strong skills in visual hierarchy, layout, and information architecture, with a growing understanding of user-centered design methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Comfortable using and contributing to the design system while designing for scale and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Good working knowledge of user research processes and customer behavior in product contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;Ability to communicate design decisions clearly and align stakeholders through thoughtful rationale.&lt;/li&gt;
