&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Product Manager is responsible for the planning and execution of successful product initiatives.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This includes understanding and prioritizing product and customer needs, defining product goals, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;working closely with engineering, product owners, and business stakeholders to bring solutions to market.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The role monitors product performance through market analysis, a deep&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;understanding of customer needs, and objective data analysis and reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
