&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain domain expertise on the product, market, and competitors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess product opportunities and contribute meaningfully to ideation and prioritization for new&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;initiatives and products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure transparency and alignment with organizational stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, product owners, marketing and operational functions to ensure successful product deliveries and launches&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, prioritize, and execute post-launch optimizations and improvements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report objectively on product performance, including an understanding of related incidents&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the “Canadian Champion” – always ensuring our Canadian customer preferences are considered and their requirements met&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
