&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - working in a fast-paced and ever-changing industry, new problems and exciting solutions are never too far away. There are always opportunities to learn new skills and broaden your horizons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A sense of achievement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - Our teams own their own software and when that awesome new feature ships to users and the positive feedback starts rolling in, you can feel really proud of what you and your team created&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - clear and defined career pathways for every role at every level, a supportive manager, loads of learning opportunities and even 10% of your time to dedicate to your learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; - everyone at FanDuel works for each other, we win together, make mistakes together and have lots of fun doing it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A trusting work environment where productivity is valued above all else, giving you autonomy and ownership of your time and work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great financial package &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;- Including salary, bonus, pension, private healthcare, share save scheme, flexible working &amp;amp; holiday policy along with a number of other benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is an equal opportunities employer. Diversity and inclusion in FanDuel means that we respect and value everyone as individuals. We don&#39;t tolerate bias, judgement or harassment. Our focus is on developing employees so that they reach their full potential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;FanDuel is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please email&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;mailto:Benefits@fanduel.com&quot;&gt;Benefits@fanduel.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The requirements listed in our job descriptions are guidelines, not hard and fast rules. You don’t have to satisfy every requirement or meet every qualification listed. If your skills are transferable and you are in the ballpark experience-wise, we&#39;d love to speak to you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE POSITION&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;FanDuel is s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;eeking a highly motivated and experienced individual to join our UX &amp;amp; Design team as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;Senior&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;UX Researcher. You’ll take part in meaningful work and real-life projects as you gain an in-depth look into the inner workings of one of the world&#39;s premier sports-technology &amp;amp; entertainment companies. You&#39;ll learn from some of the most innovative and experienced minds in the industry and improve your knowledge of User Experience processes in a fast-paced environment. Are you passionate about sports and/or gaming? Come join FanDuel on our quest to offer the best-in-class sports gaming experience for our customers and fans. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;This position will support our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;Sports &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW182391549 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the specific responsibilities outlined above, employees may be required to perform other such duties as assigned by the Company. This ensures operational flexibility and allows the Company to meet evolving business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Senior&amp;nbsp;UX Researcher on&amp;nbsp;the Sports&amp;nbsp;team, you will collaborate closely with a multi-disciplinary team&amp;nbsp;comprised of Product Managers, Product Designers, Content Designers,&amp;nbsp;Engineers, Marketers, and Analysts&amp;nbsp;to bring user insights to the product design process.&amp;nbsp;In this role you will be required to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrate an advanced understanding of our users and how they engage with our products.&amp;nbsp;Demonstrate a solid understanding of the product under study, including the relevant journeys and user needs and challenges, and the FanDuel&amp;nbsp;business as a whole.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Successfully organize, facilitate, and analyze unmoderated and moderated user research, and conduct more complex user research&amp;nbsp;(diary studies, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Integrate&amp;nbsp;analytics and experimentation data and ideas into research planning and reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Connect research to the product, including proactively suggesting and conducting impactful research that targets product priorities and gaps in user knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify areas of improvement across the product and make recommendations for potential solutions&amp;nbsp;based on research recommendations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure that research is integrated into strategic conversations, working across teams to align insights with business and user needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coach junior researchers on stakeholder collaboration and&amp;nbsp;research craft.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[0,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE STATS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we&#39;re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5+ years of previous User Experience Research Experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of User Experience Research methodologies and best practices. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success working as part of a cross-functional team that includes UX Design, Product, and Engineering. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of sports and/or experience working within a heavily regulated industry is a plus. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate working knowledge of AI capabilities and limitations as they apply to user research, including leveraging AI tools to improve efficiency and augment qualitative and quantitative analysis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don’t check all the boxes? That’s okay! We encourage you to still apply if you feel like you possess an adjacent skillet and are interested in learning more about this position. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
